  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: LightWarmup
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: warmup_flight
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 0
  _narratorPrompt: Let us warm up. Nothing on the line, nobody dies, you have my word, for whatever that is worth down here. One gift, yours to keep forever. Would you rather be able to fly, or to move through the world completely unseen. Do not overthink it. I will know if you lie.
  _choices:
  - _id: fly
    _label: Fly
    _narratorReact: Up and off the ground. Of course you would. You want them craning their necks to watch you go. A man who sat up high in life still reaches for the height. Noted.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 55
    _profileImpact: []
  - _id: invisible
    _label: Go unseen
    _narratorReact: Unseen. You would rather slip out of the room than command it. Curious, from a man who spent his days being looked up at. We will find out what else you would rather hide.
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 45
    _profileImpact: []
  _figuresBranded: 0
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _crowdSafeFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: the line
